  - gene expression
  - Hallmark pathways
  - reproducibility

abstract: >
  Code, frozen comparison targets and figure renderers for a fixed 16-member Hallmark
  transcriptomic score (Score16) evaluated in four adult sepsis discovery cohorts and three
  external adult cohorts. The package recomputes the analysis stages from patient- and
  donor-level processed inputs; raw-data preprocessing is an external prerequisite.

preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: "A blood transcriptomic pathway signature associated with mortality in sepsis"
